  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Sustainable Master Planning For The Kolkata And Lucknow International Airports, through Landrum &amp; Brown, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical assistance (TA) grant to the Airports Authority of India (AAI) will deliver a twenty-year master and capital improvement plans to sustainably expand the operational capacities of the Kolkata and Lucknow International Airports. Landrum &amp; Brown will conduct the master planning, which will incorporate environmental sustainability best practices, to accommodate the anticipated demand at two of the fastest growing airports within AAI&apos;s network. This no-cost amendment would amend the Sustainable Master Planning for the Kolkata and Udaipur Airports TA for the AAI. The amendment would update the title of the grant to Sustainable Master Planning for the Kolkata, Lucknow and Udaipur Airports to reflect the change of the second airport to Udaipur. The amendment would also change the Contractor to Landrum &amp; Brown, Inc. Under this TA, Landrum &amp; Brown will deliver master and capital improvement plans to sustainably expand the operational capacities of two airports in AAIs network.</narrative>
  </description>
